# Task 145-013: Monitor Adapter Pattern — 3 Backend Otonom

## Plan

1. Create `src/orchestra/monitor-adapter.ts` (~300 LoC)
   - Define interfaces: WorkerInfo, ResourceUsage, MonitorAdapter
   - Implement DockerMonitorAdapter (docker ps, docker logs, docker stats, docker kill)
   - Implement TmuxMonitorAdapter (tmux ls, tmux capture-pane, tmux kill-session)
   - Implement SubprocessMonitorAdapter (.deckent/workers/*.pid, ps, kill)
   - Factory function: createMonitorAdapter(config) → MonitorAdapter

2. Create `tests/orchestra/monitor-adapter.test.ts` (10+ tests)
   - Factory tests: docker/tmux/subprocess/unknown
   - Contract tests per adapter: listActiveWorkers, captureWorkerOutput, killWorker, getResourceUsage
   - Subprocess captureWorkerOutput returns placeholder
   - Tmux getResourceUsage returns null

3. Verify: tsc --noEmit + vitest run

## Key Decisions
- Use execSync/spawnSync for shell commands (ADR-006 compliance)
- Wrap in try/catch to handle missing docker/tmux gracefully
- SubprocessAdapter reads PID files from .deckent/workers/
- All methods are async (interface contract) but internally may use sync exec
